WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:10.018
Ringo sighed. "You're here too?"

2
00:00:10.019 --> 00:00:16.054
Lucy shrugged. "Captain Nova said I work hard."

3
00:00:16.055 --> 00:00:18.437
Ringo reached for his drink.

4
00:00:18.438 --> 00:00:26.846
A robot zoomed over. "I'll get that, sir!"

5
00:00:26.847 --> 00:00:29.825
A different robot brought a new drink.

6
00:00:29.826 --> 00:00:49.078
"Another drink for you!"

7
00:00:49.079 --> 00:00:52.176
Ringo and Lucy sat.

8
00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:59.849
"Ooh!" someone said. "I see the glitter clouds!"

9
00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:04.534
The clouds sparkled with bright colors.

10
00:01:04.535 --> 00:01:08.588
Suddenly a strong wind blew.

11
00:01:08.589 --> 00:01:11.476
Glitter blew all over the deck.

12
00:01:11.477 --> 00:01:20.637
Ringo giggled. "The glitter tickles!"

13
00:01:20.638 --> 00:01:25.275
A robot was covered with glitter.

14
00:01:25.276 --> 00:01:28.533
He bumped into a passenger.

15
00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:30.979
"Sorry," the robot said.

16
00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:39.031
Small sparks and glitter shot from the robot's mouth.

17
00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:43.775
"That's odd," Ringo thought.

18
00:01:43.776 --> 00:01:47.339
Lucy waved to a robot.

19
00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:50.728
"Do you have space nachos?"

20
00:01:50.729 --> 00:01:52.981
"Yes!" the robot said.

21
00:01:52.982 --> 00:01:55.686
"I'll be right back!"

22
00:01:55.687 --> 00:02:00.207
Lots of glitter blew around the deck.

23
00:02:00.208 --> 00:02:04.138
"Good news, Ringo!" Lucy said.

24
00:02:04.139 --> 00:02:06.392
"This ship has a gym."

25
00:02:06.393 --> 00:02:11.747
Ringo rolled his eyes. "Great."

26
00:02:11.748 --> 00:02:14.801
The robot came back with a plate.

27
00:02:14.802 --> 00:02:16.405
"Nachos for—"

28
00:02:16.406 --> 00:02:18.231
Bzzt! Bzzt!

29
00:02:18.232 --> 00:02:21.721
Sparks and glitter shot from the robot.

30
00:02:21.722 --> 00:02:23.783
Ringo jumped up.

31
00:02:23.784 --> 00:02:26.803
"Are you okay?" he asked.

32
00:02:26.804 --> 00:02:31.371
The robot spilled the nachos on Lucy.

33
00:02:31.372 --> 00:02:33.695
Lucy made a fist.

34
00:02:33.696 --> 00:02:40.476
"I'm covered in cheese!"

